-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §42 ותק למענק יובל: from the June 2012
-- salary, the accumulated teaching seniority a jubilee grant asks under §8
-- of the collective agreement of 31.8.94 is 25 years, in place of the 30
-- that section sets; the grant's other rules are unchanged, and are §8's
-- (imported: 1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `1994-08-31_oz-latmura_wage-supplements-1994`

§ `42 ותק למענק יובל`

§§ `42(א)`

-- (א): from the salary of June 2012 (convention dates.salary-month), the
-- accumulated seniority in teaching required for the jubilee grant of §8 of
-- the collective agreement of 31.8.94 is 25 years, "במקום 30 שנה כמפורט
-- בסעיף האמור". Before that salary §42 sets nothing: the 30 years are
-- §8's (imported; §42 quotes them as §8 prints them). Years are whole
-- years completed (convention thresholds.seniority). Part י speaks of
-- every teaching employee (§4(א)), on the reform's terms or not.
@ref akn:art_42__para_a
`the first salary month of section 42` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2012 6

`the jubilee seniority section 42 sets` MEANS 25

`the jubilee seniority section 8 of the agreement of 31.8.94 sets, as section 42 quotes it` MEANS 30

GIVEN `the salary month` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the Oz salary month` counts it
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` `the salary month` IS
    IF `the salary month` AT LEAST `the first salary month of section 42`
    THEN JUST `the jubilee seniority section 42 sets`
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN `the salary month` IS A NUMBER
      `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the jubilee seniority under section 42 in` `the salary month` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IF
    CONSIDER `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` `the salary month`
    WHEN JUST years THEN `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` AT LEAST years
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `42(ב)`

-- (ב): the agreement does not change the other rules that apply to the
-- jubilee grant: they are §8's (imported). The grant is 60% of the salary
-- determining the pension and severance pay, paid with the salary of June
-- every year, by the teacher's position share that year; the seniority it
-- asks is §8's 30 years before §42's first month and §42's 25 from it.
@ref akn:art_42__para_b
GIVEN `the salary month` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the Oz salary month` counts it
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority required in` `the salary month` IS
    CONSIDER `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` `the salary month`
    WHEN JUST years THEN years
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the jubilee seniority section 8 of the 1994 Oz agreement requires`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER @desc the salary month: year and month
      `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER
      `the determining salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary determining the pension and severance pay, as §8 of the agreement of 31.8.94 defines it
      `the position share that year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee grant with the salary of` y m `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` `the determining salary` `the position share that year` IS
    IF     `the 1994 Oz jubilee grant is paid with the salary of` y m
       AND `has the jubilee seniority of` `whole years of accumulated teaching seniority` (`the jubilee seniority required in` (`the Oz salary month` y m))
    THEN `the 1994 Oz jubilee grant` `the determining salary` `the position share that year`
    ELSE 0

§§ `42 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 6) EQUALS JUST 25
#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 42 requires in` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 5) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `has the jubilee seniority under section 42 in` (`the Oz salary month` 2013 6) 25
#ASSERT NOT `has the jubilee seniority under section 42 in` (`the Oz salary month` 2013 6) 24
-- five years fewer than the 30 the section replaces, which are §8's own
#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 8 of the agreement of 31.8.94 sets, as section 42 quotes it` MINUS `the jubilee seniority section 42 sets` EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority section 8 of the agreement of 31.8.94 sets, as section 42 quotes it` EQUALS `the jubilee seniority section 8 of the 1994 Oz agreement requires`
-- 27 years: no grant in June 2011, 60% of 12,000 at 80% in June 2012;
-- none in July
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant with the salary of` 2011 6 27 12000 0.8 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant with the salary of` 2012 6 27 12000 0.8 EQUALS 5760
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant with the salary of` 2012 7 27 12000 0.8 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the jubilee grant with the salary of` 2011 6 30 12000 1 EQUALS 7200
